            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne naap ke instruments jaane aur ye bhi dekha ki har instrument ka ek **least count** hota hai: wo sabse chhota hissa jo wo naap sakta hai. Zero error aur parallax jaisi galtiyon ke baare mein bhi pata chala.\n\nAb ek sawaal: kya koi bhi instrument, chahe kitna bhi accha ho, **bilkul sahi** naap de sakta hai? Jawab hai: nahi. Har naap mein thodi si gadbad rehti hi hai. Physics ka kaam ye gadbad ko **chhupana** nahi, balki usse **samajhna, kam karna aur imaandari se batana** hai. Is topic mein yahi seekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne naap ke instruments jaane aur ye bhi dekha ki har instrument ka ek **least count** hota hai: wo sabse chhota hissa jo wo naap sakta hai. Zero error aur parallax jaisi galtiyon ke baare mein bhi pata chala.\n\nAb ek sawaal: kya koi bhi instrument, chahe kitna bhi accha ho, **bilkul sahi** naap de sakta hai? Jawab hai: nahi. Har naap mein thodi si gadbad rehti hi hai. Physics ka kaam ye gadbad ko **chhupana** nahi, balki usse **samajhna, kam karna aur imaandari se batana** hai. Is topic mein yahi seekhenge."
