            "heading": "Speed gun ka 108",
            "headingHinglish": "Speed gun ka 108",
            "body": "Ek cricket academy mein subah ka practice chal raha tha. Naya tez gendbaaz **Aadi** apna ek zordaar delivery phenk kar hanpte hue wapas aaya. Coach **Mr. Bedi** ke haath mein speed gun thi, aur uski screen par likha tha: **108 km/h**.\n\nAadi ne screen dekhi aur bola, \"Sir, 108 km/h to bahut zyada lagta hai, par mujhe ye feel nahi aa raha. Ye meter per second mein kitna hua? Aur pitch to sirf 20 m lambi hai. Gend ko wo 20 m tay karne mein kitna time lagta hoga? Kya 108 km/h wahi cheez hai jo poori pitch ka average speed hota?\"\n\nMr. Bedi muskuraye. \"Ek saath teen sawaal! Chalo ek-ek karke dekhte hain. Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge. Pehle ye samajh lo ki speed ka matlab hota kya hai.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek cricket academy mein subah ka practice chal raha tha. Naya tez gendbaaz **Aadi** apna ek zordaar delivery phenk kar hanpte hue wapas aaya. Coach **Mr. Bedi** ke haath mein speed gun thi, aur uski screen par likha tha: **108 km/h**.\n\nAadi ne screen dekhi aur bola, \"Sir, 108 km/h to bahut zyada lagta hai, par mujhe ye feel nahi aa raha. Ye meter per second mein kitna hua? Aur pitch to sirf 20 m lambi hai. Gend ko wo 20 m tay karne mein kitna time lagta hoga? Kya 108 km/h wahi cheez hai jo poori pitch ka average speed hota?\"\n\nMr. Bedi muskuraye. \"Ek saath teen sawaal! Chalo ek-ek karke dekhte hain. Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge. Pehle ye samajh lo ki speed ka matlab hota kya hai.\""
