            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Circular motion (vritteey gati)** | Cheez ka path ek circle hota hai | Chaak par laal boond |\n| **Uniform circular motion** | Circle par chalna aur speed har pal same rehna | Chaak jo ek hi raftaar se ghoom raha hai |\n| **Time period (T)** | Ek poora chakkar lagane mein lagne wala time | 2 s mein ek round, to T = 2 s |\n| **Frequency (f)** | Ek second mein kitne chakkar | 5 rounds har second, to f = 5 Hz |\n| **Hertz (Hz)** | Frequency ka SI unit: 1 Hz = 1 chakkar har second = 1/s | 50 Hz |\n| **rpm** | Rounds per minute: ek minute mein kitne chakkar | 60 rpm = 1 Hz |\n| **Tangent (sparsh-rekha)** | Circle ko ek point par sirf chhookar jaane wali seedhi line | Boond chhootne par isi line par jaati hai |\n| **Radius (r)** | Circle ke centre se uske kinare tak ki doori | Chaak ke centre se boond tak 0.15 m |",
