            "bodyHinglish": "Shahar ke fun fair mein bumper cars (dodgem) ka bada sa ring hai. Operator Mr. Saini ring ke kinare khade hain aur seeti bajakar cars ko chalate-rukte dekh rahe hain. Rudra apni car chalate hue ek khadi hui car se **dham!** se takra gaya. Takkar ke baad Rudra ki car dheemi ho gayi, aur jo car khadi thi wo aage sarakne lagi.\n\nRudra hansta hua bahar aaya aur bola, \"Saini uncle, meri car ki speed to kam ho gayi, par doosri car ko to mazaa aa gaya. Meri taakat kahan gayi?\"\n\nMr. Saini muskuraye. \"Taakat gayi nahi beta, bas ek car se doosri car mein chali gayi. Agar tum **dono cars ki takat (momentum) jod do**, to takkar se pehle aur takkar ke baad ka total **same** nikalega.\"\n\nRudra ko yakeen nahi hua. Chalo, check karte hain."
