            "headingHinglish": "Samundar kinare ki shaam",
            "body": "Ek samundar kinare ke chhote se kasbe mein shaam ho rahi hai. Mr. Pereira machhuaare hain; wo apni naav ko retai se kaafi upar kheench rahe hain aur jaal sukha rahe hain. Paas mein bachchi Elisha khadi hai.\n\nElisha ne dopahar mein yahi beach dekha tha: paani door peeche tha, aur geeli retai ka bahut lamba hissa khula pada tha. Ab shaam ko wahi paani chadhkar beach ke kaafi upar tak aa gaya hai, aur Mr. Pereira ko naav isiliye upar kheenchni pad rahi hai. Aasmaan mein Chaand paani ke upar chamak raha hai.\n\n\"Mr. Pereira, dopahar mein samundar kitna peeche tha, aur ab dekhiye, kitna aage aa gaya! Kya iska Chaand se koi lena-dena hai? Wo to theek paani ke upar hi chamak raha hai.\"\n\nMr. Pereira muskurate hain. \"Sahi pakda, Elisha. Hum machhuaare saalon se Chaand dekhkar hi samundar ka mizaaj samajhte hain.\"\n\nElisha ek aur sawaal poochti hai. \"Aur ek baat samajh nahi aati. Gravity to har cheez ko neeche kheenchti hai. Phir Chaand Earth par kyun nahi gir jaata?\"\n\nMr. Pereira hanskar kehte hain, \"Dono sawaal ek hi dhaage se bandhe hain, beta. Chalo, pehle Chaand ko girne se bachne wali baat samajhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek samundar kinare ke chhote se kasbe mein shaam ho rahi hai. Mr. Pereira machhuaare hain; wo apni naav ko retai se kaafi upar kheench rahe hain aur jaal sukha rahe hain. Paas mein bachchi Elisha khadi hai.\n\nElisha ne dopahar mein yahi beach dekha tha: paani door peeche tha, aur geeli retai ka bahut lamba hissa khula pada tha. Ab shaam ko wahi paani chadhkar beach ke kaafi upar tak aa gaya hai, aur Mr. Pereira ko naav isiliye upar kheenchni pad rahi hai. Aasmaan mein Chaand paani ke upar chamak raha hai.\n\n\"Mr. Pereira, dopahar mein samundar kitna peeche tha, aur ab dekhiye, kitna aage aa gaya! Kya iska Chaand se koi lena-dena hai? Wo to theek paani ke upar hi chamak raha hai.\"\n\nMr. Pereira muskurate hain. \"Sahi pakda, Elisha. Hum machhuaare saalon se Chaand dekhkar hi samundar ka mizaaj samajhte hain.\"\n\nElisha ek aur sawaal poochti hai. \"Aur ek baat samajh nahi aati. Gravity to har cheez ko neeche kheenchti hai. Phir Chaand Earth par kyun nahi gir jaata?\"\n\nMr. Pereira hanskar kehte hain, \"Dono sawaal ek hi dhaage se bandhe hain, beta. Chalo, pehle Chaand ko girne se bachne wali baat samajhte hain.\""
