            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Satellite (upgrah)** | Wo cheez jo kisi bade pind (jaise Earth) ke chaaro taraf ek fixed path mein ghoomti hai | Chaand, ya Earth ke chaaro taraf ghoomta weather satellite |\n| **Natural satellite** | Prakriti ka banaya satellite | Chaand (Earth ka) |\n| **Artificial satellite** | Insaan ka banaya aur rocket se bheja gaya satellite | Communication ya weather satellite |\n| **Orbit (kaksha)** | Wo path jis par satellite ghoomta hai | Chaand ka Earth ke chaaro taraf ka path |\n| **Time period (T)** | Ek poora chakkar lagane ka time | Chaand ka lagbhag 27 din |\n| **Free fall** | Sirf gravity ke asar mein girna | Topic 3 aur 4 mein dekha tha |\n| **Tide (jwaar-bhaata)** | Samundar ke paani ka waqt waqt par upar chadhna aur neeche utarna | Shaam ko paani beach par upar, dopahar mein peeche |\n| **High tide aur low tide** | Paani ka sabse upar hona (high) aur sabse neeche hona (low) | Kinare par paani ki line ka aage-peeche hona |\n| **Spring tide aur neap tide** | Sabse badi aur sabse chhoti tide ke din | Poornima/amavasya par spring, aadhe Chaand par neap |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Satellite (upgrah)** | Wo cheez jo kisi bade pind (jaise Earth) ke chaaro taraf ek fixed path mein ghoomti hai | Chaand, ya Earth ke chaaro taraf ghoomta weather satellite |\n| **Natural satellite** | Prakriti ka banaya satellite | Chaand (Earth ka) |\n| **Artificial satellite** | Insaan ka banaya aur rocket se bheja gaya satellite | Communication ya weather satellite |\n| **Orbit (kaksha)** | Wo path jis par satellite ghoomta hai | Chaand ka Earth ke chaaro taraf ka path |\n| **Time period (T)** | Ek poora chakkar lagane ka time | Chaand ka lagbhag 27 din |\n| **Free fall** | Sirf gravity ke asar mein girna | Topic 3 aur 4 mein dekha tha |\n| **Tide (jwaar-bhaata)** | Samundar ke paani ka waqt waqt par upar chadhna aur neeche utarna | Shaam ko paani beach par upar, dopahar mein peeche |\n| **High tide aur low tide** | Paani ka sabse upar hona (high) aur sabse neeche hona (low) | Kinare par paani ki line ka aage-peeche hona |\n| **Spring tide aur neap tide** | Sabse badi aur sabse chhoti tide ke din | Poornima/amavasya par spring, aadhe Chaand par neap |"
