            "question": "A metal piece weighs 50 gf in air and 40 gf when completely immersed in water. What is its Relative Density (RD) and its density in kg/m³?",
            "questionHinglish": "Ek dhatu (metal) ka tukda hawa mein 50 gf aur paani mein poora dubone par 40 gf ka lagta hai. Iski Relative Density (RD) aur density (kg/m³ mein) nikalo.",
