            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki work **positive, negative ya zero** ho sakta hai. Jab force aur displacement ek hi disha mein ho, to work positive hota hai, aur wo kuch **de deta hai** us cheez ko jis par work hua. Ab sawal ye hai: wo \"kuch\" aakhir hai kya? Cheez ko kya mil raha hai, aur jab koi cheez work karti hai to wo apne andar se kya kharch karti hai? Is \"kuch\" ka naam hai **energy**.",
