            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Energy (urja)** | Work karne ki kshamta (ability): jis cheez mein energy hai, wo work kar sakti hai | Chalta hua hathoda nail ko thok sakta hai |\n| **Joule (J)** | Energy ka SI unit (work ka bhi wahi) | 1 J |\n| **Kilojoule (kJ)** | 1000 joule | 1 kJ = 1000 J |\n| **Energy ka roop (form)** | Energy ka alag-alag type | Heat, light, sound |\n| **Energy transformation** | Energy ka ek roop se doosre roop mein badalna | Bulb: electrical → light + heat |\n| **Source of energy** | Wo cheez jisse hamein energy milti hai | Sun, koyla, hawa |\n| **Kilocalorie (kcal)** | Khane ki energy napne ki purani ikai | 1 kcal ≈ 4.2 kJ (lagbhag) |",
