            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne pulley dekhi: rassi aur chakke ka jod, jisme rassi ke kitne tukde load ko sambhal rahe hain, wahi ideal MA bata deta tha. Par simple machines ka parivaar sirf rassi aur chakke tak nahi rukta. Jab tum kisi ramp par chadhte ho, kisi bolt ko ghumate ho, ya darwaze ka handle ghumate ho, to tum bina jaane ek machine hi chala rahe ho. Is topic mein hum chaar aur simple machines dekhenge: **inclined plane (dhalaan), wedge (fanna), screw aur wheel-and-axle**. Chaaron mein wahi purana sawal rahega: kitna effort, kitna load, aur MA kitna.\n\n**Is poore topic mein g = 10 m/s² liya gaya hai**, to 1 kg ka weight 10 N hota hai. Saare MA aur VR **ideal (bina friction ke)** liye gaye hain, jab tak alag se na bola jaye.",
