            "body": "Ms. Bhandari ek ghar mein khana banati thi. Ek din uska chhota padosi Aniket kitchen mein aaya aur bola, \"Aunty, aaj main aapka experiment dekhun?\"\n\nMs. Bhandari hanste hue boli, \"Theek hai. Dekho, ye do ek jaise steel ke pan hain. Ek mein main thoda sa tel daalti hoon, doosre mein utni hi matra (same mass) ka paani. Dono ko do ek jaise burner par, same flame par, same der ke liye rakhte hain.\"\n\nKuch der baad Ms. Bhandari ne dono mein thermometer daala. **Tel bahut garm ho chuka tha, par paani sirf thoda garm hua tha.**\n\nAniket hairaan hua, \"Aunty, flame to ek jaisi thi, time bhi same, tel aur paani ki matra bhi same. Phir tel itna zyada garm kaise ho gaya? Kya burner ne tel ko zyada heat di?\"\n\nMs. Bhandari boli, \"Nahi beta, dono ko lagbhag barabar heat mili. Farak flame mein nahi, **cheez (material) mein** hai. Chalo, ise numbers se samjhte hain.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ms. Bhandari ek ghar mein khana banati thi. Ek din uska chhota padosi Aniket kitchen mein aaya aur bola, \"Aunty, aaj main aapka experiment dekhun?\"\n\nMs. Bhandari hanste hue boli, \"Theek hai. Dekho, ye do ek jaise steel ke pan hain. Ek mein main thoda sa tel daalti hoon, doosre mein utni hi matra (same mass) ka paani. Dono ko do ek jaise burner par, same flame par, same der ke liye rakhte hain.\"\n\nKuch der baad Ms. Bhandari ne dono mein thermometer daala. **Tel bahut garm ho chuka tha, par paani sirf thoda garm hua tha.**\n\nAniket hairaan hua, \"Aunty, flame to ek jaisi thi, time bhi same, tel aur paani ki matra bhi same. Phir tel itna zyada garm kaise ho gaya? Kya burner ne tel ko zyada heat di?\"\n\nMs. Bhandari boli, \"Nahi beta, dono ko lagbhag barabar heat mili. Farak flame mein nahi, **cheez (material) mein** hai. Chalo, ise numbers se samjhte hain.\" Is kahani ko hum topic ke beech mein solve karenge."
