            "heading": "Part C: Radiation: bina kisi medium ke garmi",
            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Radiation: bina kisi medium ke garmi",
            "body": "### Sun ki garmi\n\nSun aur Earth ke beech lagbhag poora **khaali space (vacuum)** hai. Wahan na koi solid hai, na paani, na hawa. Fir bhi Sun ki garmi Earth tak pahunchti hai. To ye garmi:\n\n- **conduction se nahi** aa sakti, kyunki conduction ke liye particles ki chain chahiye.\n- **convection se nahi** aa sakti, kyunki convection ke liye liquid ya gas chahiye, jo vacuum mein nahi hai.\n\nTo teesra tareeka hai **radiation**: garmi **electromagnetic waves** (infrared ke roop mein) ke saath space mein chali aati hai. In waves ko chalne ke liye kisi medium ki zaroorat **nahi** hoti.\n\n**Radiation: bina kisi medium ke, waves ke roop mein heat ka transfer.**\n\n### Aag ke paas mehsoos hone wali garmi\n\nAag ke paas baithkar haath ko aag ki **side** mein (bagal mein) le jaao. Tumhe garmi mehsoos hogi. Ab sochte hain, ye garmi kaise aayi?\n\n- **Convection se?** Nahi. Aag ke paas ki garam hawa **upar** uthti hai, bagal mein nahi aati.\n- **Conduction se?** Nahi. Hawa bahut kamzor conductor hai.\n\nIsliye bagal mein mehsoos hone wali garmi **radiation** hai: aag se seedhi infrared waves tumhare haath tak aa rahi hain.\n\n**Har garam cheez radiation nikaalti hai:** garam chai, tumhara shareer, bulb ka filament, bhatti, sab. Cheez jitni garam, utni zyada radiation nikaalti hai (iska poora formula aage ki class mein aayega, abhi sirf itna yaad rakho).\n\n### Kaali aur safed surface\n\nRadiation ke saath surface ka **rang aur chamak** bhi bahut matter karte hain.\n\n| Surface | Radiation sokhta hai (absorb) | Radiation nikaalta hai (emit) | Radiation laut-ata hai (reflect) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Kaali, khurdari (dark, rough) | Zyada | Zyada | Kam |\n| Safed ya chamakdaar (white, shiny) | Kam | Kam | Zyada |\n\nIs baat ke roz ke examples:\n\n1. **Sardiyon mein kaale ya gehre rang ke kapde:** kaala rang dhoop ki garmi zyada sokhta hai, isliye sardi mein achha lagta hai.\n2. **Garmiyon mein safed ya halke rang ke kapde:** safed rang zyada dhoop wapas laut deta hai, isliye kam garam lagta hai.\n3. **Ghar safed rang se rangna:** garmi mein ghar ki deewarein aur chhat kam garam hoti hain kyunki safed rang dhoop ko wapas reflect kar deta hai.\n4. **Solar cooker ki kaali sateh:** solar cooker ke andar ki sateh aur bartan ko kaala rangte hain taaki wo zyada se zyada dhoop ki garmi sokh le.\n5. **Chamakdaar teapot:** ek shiny (chamakdaar) teapot **kam radiation nikaalta hai**, isliye uski chai kaali, ghisi hui teapot ke muqable der tak garam rehti hai.\n6. **Gaadi ke windscreen ke aage sunshade:** dhoop mein khadi gaadi mein chamakdaar sunshade (reflective sheet) lagate hain jo dhoop ko wapas laut deti hai, taaki gaadi ke andar kam garmi aaye.\n\n**Greenhouse (sirf naam):** kaanch ke ghar (greenhouse) mein dhoop ki radiation andar aa jaati hai, par andar ki garmi kaanch se bahar nahi nikal paati. Isi idea par aage ki class mein \"greenhouse effect\" padhoge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "### Sun ki garmi\n\nSun aur Earth ke beech lagbhag poora **khaali space (vacuum)** hai. Wahan na koi solid hai, na paani, na hawa. Fir bhi Sun ki garmi Earth tak pahunchti hai. To ye garmi:\n\n- **conduction se nahi** aa sakti, kyunki conduction ke liye particles ki chain chahiye.\n- **convection se nahi** aa sakti, kyunki convection ke liye liquid ya gas chahiye, jo vacuum mein nahi hai.\n\nTo teesra tareeka hai **radiation**: garmi **electromagnetic waves** (infrared ke roop mein) ke saath space mein chali aati hai. In waves ko chalne ke liye kisi medium ki zaroorat **nahi** hoti.\n\n**Radiation: bina kisi medium ke, waves ke roop mein heat ka transfer.**\n\n### Aag ke paas mehsoos hone wali garmi\n\nAag ke paas baithkar haath ko aag ki **side** mein (bagal mein) le jaao. Tumhe garmi mehsoos hogi. Ab sochte hain, ye garmi kaise aayi?\n\n- **Convection se?** Nahi. Aag ke paas ki garam hawa **upar** uthti hai, bagal mein nahi aati.\n- **Conduction se?** Nahi. Hawa bahut kamzor conductor hai.\n\nIsliye bagal mein mehsoos hone wali garmi **radiation** hai: aag se seedhi infrared waves tumhare haath tak aa rahi hain.\n\n**Har garam cheez radiation nikaalti hai:** garam chai, tumhara shareer, bulb ka filament, bhatti, sab. Cheez jitni garam, utni zyada radiation nikaalti hai (iska poora formula aage ki class mein aayega, abhi sirf itna yaad rakho).\n\n### Kaali aur safed surface\n\nRadiation ke saath surface ka **rang aur chamak** bhi bahut matter karte hain.\n\n| Surface | Radiation sokhta hai (absorb) | Radiation nikaalta hai (emit) | Radiation laut-ata hai (reflect) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Kaali, khurdari (dark, rough) | Zyada | Zyada | Kam |\n| Safed ya chamakdaar (white, shiny) | Kam | Kam | Zyada |\n\nIs baat ke roz ke examples:\n\n1. **Sardiyon mein kaale ya gehre rang ke kapde:** kaala rang dhoop ki garmi zyada sokhta hai, isliye sardi mein achha lagta hai.\n2. **Garmiyon mein safed ya halke rang ke kapde:** safed rang zyada dhoop wapas laut deta hai, isliye kam garam lagta hai.\n3. **Ghar safed rang se rangna:** garmi mein ghar ki deewarein aur chhat kam garam hoti hain kyunki safed rang dhoop ko wapas reflect kar deta hai.\n4. **Solar cooker ki kaali sateh:** solar cooker ke andar ki sateh aur bartan ko kaala rangte hain taaki wo zyada se zyada dhoop ki garmi sokh le.\n5. **Chamakdaar teapot:** ek shiny (chamakdaar) teapot **kam radiation nikaalta hai**, isliye uski chai kaali, ghisi hui teapot ke muqable der tak garam rehti hai.\n6. **Gaadi ke windscreen ke aage sunshade:** dhoop mein khadi gaadi mein chamakdaar sunshade (reflective sheet) lagate hain jo dhoop ko wapas laut deti hai, taaki gaadi ke andar kam garmi aaye.\n\n**Greenhouse (sirf naam):** kaanch ke ghar (greenhouse) mein dhoop ki radiation andar aa jaati hai, par andar ki garmi kaanch se bahar nahi nikal paati. Isi idea par aage ki class mein \"greenhouse effect\" padhoge."
