            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki hawa mein sound ek wave ki tarah chalti hai: kahin hawa ke kan pass-pass aa jaate hain (compression), kahin door-door ho jaate hain (rarefaction), aur ye pattern aage badhta jaata hai. Wave energy ko aage le jaati hai, hawa ke kan khud aage nahi bhaagte. Ab sawal ye hai ki is wave ko **numbers mein kaise bataya jaye**? Do sounds ko alag-alag kaise pehchana jaye? Is topic mein hum wave ke teen number seekhenge, aur ek chhota sa formula **v = f λ** khud banayenge.\n\n**Is poore topic mein: sound ki speed hawa mein v = 340 m/s maanenge.** (Alag-alag medium mein speed kyun alag hoti hai, wo agle topic mein.)"
