            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Amplitude (A)** | Kan ka apni beech wali (mean) jagah se maximum displacement (ya pressure ka maximum badlaav). Unit: m (ya pressure ke liye Pa) | Kan beech se 0.1 mm tak door jaata hai: A = 0.1 mm |\n| **Wavelength (λ)** | Do lagataar compressions (ya do lagataar rarefactions) ke beech ki doori. SI unit: m | Do compressions 0.77 m door hain: λ = 0.77 m |\n| **Frequency (f)** | 1 second mein kitni poori vibrations (oscillations). SI unit: hertz (Hz) | 440 Hz = 1 second mein 440 vibrations |\n| **Time period (T)** | Ek poori vibration mein lagne wala samay. Unit: second (s) | f = 50 Hz, to T = 0.02 s |\n| **Wave speed (v)** | Wave ka koi point (jaise ek compression) 1 second mein kitni doori tay karta hai. Unit: m/s | Hawa mein sound: 340 m/s |\n| **Hertz (Hz)** | Frequency ka unit: 1 Hz = 1 vibration per second = 1 s⁻¹ | 1 kHz = 1000 Hz |"
